#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:5
msgid "data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"STORE_LOAD_LILY_EMPORIUM\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"Before you shop, you still have some time to do something else aboard the "
"ship."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:7
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"STORE_LOAD_LILY_EMPORIUM\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:11
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"STORE_LOAD_LILY_EMPORIUM\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:18
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"STORE_LOAD_LILY_EMPORIUM_UNLOCKED\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"Before you shop, you still have some time to do something else aboard the "
"ship."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:20
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"STORE_LOAD_LILY_EMPORIUM_UNLOCKED\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:24
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"STORE_LOAD_LILY_EMPORIUM_UNLOCKED\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:30
msgid "data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_MAD_FIGHT\"]/text"
msgstr "It seems Lily is quite mad. There's no option but to fight this ship!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:32
msgid "data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_MAD_FIGHT\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:45
msgid "data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_DESTROYED\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"Somehow, you have destroyed the station. It breaks into flickering colorful pieces, which then proceed to fade out of existence.\n"
"Unfortunately, there's nothing left to scrap of the station itself."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:51
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_DESTROYED\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:53
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_DESTROYED\"]/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"However, one of the weapons on the station seems to have survived the fight "
"and is floating in space now! You hastily pick it up."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:58
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_DESTROYED\"]/choice/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:60
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_DESTROYED\"]/choice/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"Shortly after, Lily contacts you.\n"
"\"Oh, so this stage of testing is complete!--\"\n"
"\"The results are unexpected... and most impressive!--\"\n"
"\"You and your ship are surely strong ones since you've managed to pull this off!--\"\n"
"\"And that means - you will make excellent subjects for further testing!--\""

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:66
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_DESTROYED\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:68
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_DESTROYED\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Oh, and luckily for you it won't even involve you getting shot at by experimental weapons--\"\n"
"\"Only merely carrying and using some potentially volatile tech, hahe!--\"\n"
"\"Alright, here we go, and no, you can't back out--\""

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:73
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_DESTROYED\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:75
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_DESTROYED\"]/choice/event/choice/event/choice/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"And take this as well--\"\n"
"\"It won't kill you - probably--\""

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:103
msgid "data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_QUEST_START\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You have arrived at the advertised location of the \"Beam Emporium\" store. "
"Oddly, the beacon appears to be empty, with no ships there. However, you "
"feel a strange sense of unease, as if someone was watching you..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:105
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_QUEST_START\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Investigate further."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:114
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_QUEST_START\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Leave as soon as possible."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:116
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_QUEST_START\"]/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You are not interested in risking your mission to investigate odd phenomena."
" You turn around and charge your FTL drive to leave immediately."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:147
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_GLITCH_CONTINUE\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You continue your search for the store, as your systems suddenly glitch out "
"and reboot!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:165
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/FTL/event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_CEL_FOUND\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You continue spending your time searching for the store. However, despite "
"your best effort, you still can't find anything here. Why the advertisement "
"for a store is there is a mystery."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:191
msgid "data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_TOWR\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You finally notice a relatively normal looking space station, although it seems to be protected by an unusual energy shield.\n"
"It hails you: \"Welcome to Lily's Beam Emporium!--\"\n"
"\"... Wait. Is this The One Who Rhymes themselves?!\n"
"As a renegade, no less?! Hold on I must be dreaming, am I?\n"
"Didn't expect you again... much less in these circumstances--\n"
"Feel free to take anything from my store, of course. Let's have fun and make chaos!--\""

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:198
msgid "data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_TOWR\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:219
msgid "data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_TOWR_1\"]/text"
msgstr "\"From Lily, you are bestowed a gift!--\""

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:224
msgid "data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_TOWR_1\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:235
msgid "data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_TOWR_2\"]/text"
msgstr "\"And another one, to sate your appetite!--\""

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:240
msgid "data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_TOWR_2\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:252
msgid "data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_TOWR_3\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"\"And I hope I can join with you on your run! I'd come along up until its "
"done! Would you mind?--\""

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:254
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_TOWR_3\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "That would be quite a delight!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:256
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_TOWR_3\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr "\"Let us hurry, then! Ready to fight!--\""

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:264
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_TOWR_3\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Sorry to disappoint, but for this, you I can't appoint."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:266
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_TOWR_3\"]/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"That's a shame, I have to say. But feel free to browse my store anyway--\""

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:274
msgid "data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_REAL\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You finally notice a relatively normal looking space station, although it seems to be protected by an unusual energy shield.\n"
"It hails you: \"Welcome to Lily's Beam Emporium!--\n"
"A wide collection of beam and pinpoint weapons is available for sale--\"\n"
"You are pretty sure it wasn't there minutes ago..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:279
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_REAL\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Just shop."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:281
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_REAL\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You ignore the odd things that have been happening and continue to the "
"store. Luckily everything goes without further incident."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:287
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_REAL\"]/choice[@req=\"LILY_MYSTERIOUS_NOTE\"]/text"
msgstr "You remember about the mysterious note you found."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:289
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_REAL\"]/choice[@req=\"LILY_MYSTERIOUS_NOTE\"]/event/text"
msgstr "You give the mysterious note to Lily and wait for her to respond."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:291
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_REAL\"]/choice[@req=\"LILY_MYSTERIOUS_NOTE\"]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:293
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_REAL\"]/choice[@req=\"LILY_MYSTERIOUS_NOTE\"]/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"This note... in your possession? Well, that can only mean one thing - you are one of Her chosen to complete the mission. Which mission - only She knows. But I happen to be one of Her servants as well and - as such I'll be assisting from here on--\n"
"Oh, and have this to help on your travels.\""

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:300
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_REAL\"]/choice[@req=\"LILY_MYSTERIOUS_NOTE\"]/event/choice/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:302
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_REAL\"]/choice[@req=\"LILY_MYSTERIOUS_NOTE\"]/event/choice/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"Let's go then!\n"
"(Note: Lily can be contacted in the storage menu)"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:322
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_REAL\"]/choice[@req=\"LIST_CREW_SIREN\"]/text"
msgstr "Your siren recognizes the odd energy shield on the station."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:324
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_REAL\"]/choice[@req=\"LIST_CREW_SIREN\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"Your siren happens to recognize the Eldritch chaos energy on the station "
"very well, and uses their powers to send a remote message to Lily about it."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:326
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_REAL\"]/choice[@req=\"LIST_CREW_SIREN\"]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:328
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_REAL\"]/choice[@req=\"LIST_CREW_SIREN\"]/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"A Siren like you on a Renegade vessel? It's so rare to see one of you lately. Let me give you something for your travels and feel free to shop!\"\n"
"\"Would you mind letting me join you on your adventure? I think it will benefit both of our goals--\""

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:335
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_REAL\"]/choice[@req=\"LIST_CREW_SIREN\"]/event/choice/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Sure!"

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:337
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_REAL\"]/choice[@req=\"LIST_CREW_SIREN\"]/event/choice/event/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Let us hurry then!\"\n"
