#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:345
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_REAL\"]/choice[@req=\"LIST_CREW_SIREN\"]/event/choice/event/choice[2]/text"
