#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:484
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$/dummyroot/FTL/event[@name=\"LILY_EMPORIUM_AGAIN\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You finally notice a relatively normal looking space station, although it seems to be protected by an unusual energy shield.\n"
"You are pretty sure you have already seen the exact same station before, lightyears away.\n"
"It hails you: \"Oh, it's you! Welcome to Lily's Beam Emporium!--\n"
"Want to restock and rearm?--\n"
"A wide collection of beam and pinpoint weapons is available for sale--\n"
"And have some freebies, on the house--\""

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:492
